 <P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Our
general and administrative expenses increased by 75.2% from RMB1,658&nbsp;million in the six months ended September&nbsp;30, 2013 to RMB2,904&nbsp;million
(US$473&nbsp;million) in the same period in 2014. The increase was primarily due to an increase of RMB1,035&nbsp;million in payroll and benefits expenses mainly relating to an increase in
share-based compensation expense. </FONT></P>

