 <P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Our
product development expenses increased by 29.5% from RMB2,897&nbsp;million in fiscal year 2012 to RMB3,753&nbsp;million in fiscal year 2013. The increase was primarily due to an
increase of RMB694&nbsp;million in payroll and benefits costs, including share-based compensation expense, as we increased compensation packages to retain product development talent and an increase
of RMB234&nbsp;million in royalty fees paid to Yahoo driven by an increase in our&nbsp;revenue. </FONT></P>

